# Upload allowlist for `gcloud run deploy --source` and Cloud Build uploads.
# Ignore everything, then allow only what the Docker build needs.
# Credentials and OAuth client files live outside the repository and must never be listed here.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.build.json
!src/
!src/**
**/.DS_Store
